content.text:
{
  "taskSchemaVersion": 4,
  "mode": "execute",
  "task": {
    "action": "assess",
    "goal": "add a light theme for the app",
    "round": 2,
    "history": [
      {
        "question": {
          "id": "q1",
          "kind": "single",
          "text": "Should the existing dark theme remain available?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "Keep dark and add light as an alternative",
              "recommended": true
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": "Replace dark with light"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "Add light now but allow more themes later"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answer": {
          "questionId": "q1",
          "selectedOptionIds": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        "round": 1
      },
      {
        "question": {
          "id": "q2",
          "kind": "single",
          "text": "How should the app choose a theme when it starts?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "Follow the OS initially, then save any manual override",
              "recommended": true
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": "Default to dark and save the user's choice"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "Default to light and save the user's choice"
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": "Always follow the OS with no manual override"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answer": {
          "questionId": "q2",
          "selectedOptionIds": [
            "b"
          ]
        },
        "round": 1
      },
      {
        "question": {
          "id": "q3",
          "kind": "single",
          "text": "Where should users change the theme?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "Quick toggle plus a selector in Settings",
              "recommended": true
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": "Settings only"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "Quick toggle only"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answer": {
          "questionId": "q3",
          "selectedOptionIds": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        "round": 1
      },
      {
        "question": {
          "id": "q4",
          "kind": "single",
          "text": "Which interface states should receive light styling?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "All states, including join, meeting, settings, loading, and errors",
              "recommended": true
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": "Join and meeting screens only"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "Meeting screen only"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answer": {
          "questionId": "q4",
          "selectedOptionIds": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        "round": 1
      },
      {
        "question": {
          "id": "q5",
          "kind": "single",
          "text": "In light mode, how should video tiles and their media overlays appear?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "Keep media areas dark while making surrounding app chrome light",
              "recommended": true
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": "Restyle tiles and overlays as light surfaces too"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "Change only overlays; keep tile backgrounds dark"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answer": {
          "questionId": "q5",
          "selectedOptionIds": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        "round": 1
      },
      {
        "question": {
          "id": "q6",
          "kind": "single",
          "text": "What visual direction should the light palette use?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "Neutral white and light slate, preserving current blue-violet accents",
              "recommended": true
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": "Warm off-white and gray, preserving current accents"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "High-contrast pure white and black"
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": "Custom palette"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answer": {
          "questionId": "q6",
          "selectedOptionIds": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        "round": 1
      },
      {
        "question": {
          "id": "q7",
          "kind": "single",
          "text": "What accessibility target should the light theme meet?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "WCAG AA contrast with visible focus and readable controls",
              "recommended": true
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": "Match the dark theme visually without a formal contrast target"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "Aim for WCAG AAA contrast where practical"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answer": {
          "questionId": "q7",
          "selectedOptionIds": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        "round": 1
      },
      {
        "question": {
          "id": "q8",
          "kind": "single",
          "text": "Where should the quick theme toggle appear?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "Top-right header on both join and meeting screens",
              "recommended": true
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": "Join header and floating meeting controls"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "Meeting header only"
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": "Custom placement"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answer": {
          "questionId": "q8",
          "selectedOptionIds": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        "round": 2
      },
      {
        "question": {
          "id": "q9",
          "kind": "single",
          "text": "How should the quick toggle be presented?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "Sun/moon icon button with an accessible label and tooltip",
              "recommended": true
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": "Labeled Light/Dark button"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "Two-option segmented control"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answer": {
          "questionId": "q9",
          "selectedOptionIds": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        "round": 2
      },
      {
        "question": {
          "id": "q10",
          "kind": "single",
          "text": "How should theme selection fit into the existing settings modal?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "Rename it to Settings and add an Appearance section near the top",
              "recommended": true
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": "Add an Appearance section without changing the modal title"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "Add a compact theme selector in the modal header"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answer": {
          "questionId": "q10",
          "selectedOptionIds": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        "round": 2
      },
      {
        "question": {
          "id": "q11",
          "kind": "single",
          "text": "How long should the saved theme preference persist?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "Indefinitely in the renderer profile until changed or app data is cleared",
              "recommended": true
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": "Use the existing 24-hour expiring local storage behavior"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "Store it in Electron user-data configuration"
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": "Persist only for the current app session"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answer": {
          "questionId": "q11",
          "selectedOptionIds": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        "round": 2
      },
      {
        "question": {
          "id": "q12",
          "kind": "single",
          "text": "When a user changes the theme, when should it take effect?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "Immediately across the open app, with toggle and Settings kept in sync",
              "recommended": true
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": "After closing Settings"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "After restarting the app"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answer": {
          "questionId": "q12",
          "selectedOptionIds": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        "round": 2
      },
      {
        "question": {
          "id": "q13",
          "kind": "single",
          "text": "Should theme selection affect the native Electron window frame as well as the rendered interface?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "Theme the rendered interface only; leave native chrome OS-managed",
              "recommended": true
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": "Synchronize native window chrome with the selected theme"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answer": {
          "questionId": "q13",
          "selectedOptionIds": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        "round": 2
      },
      {
        "question": {
          "id": "q14",
          "kind": "single",
          "text": "Should switching themes include a visual transition?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "Brief color transition that respects reduced-motion preferences",
              "recommended": true
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": "Switch instantly with no transition"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "Use a more noticeable animated transition"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answer": {
          "questionId": "q14",
          "selectedOptionIds": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        "round": 2
      }
    ],
    "insights": [
      "The app will continue to default to dark mode, persist the user's selected theme, and offer theme controls through both a quick toggle and Settings. Light styling will cover all interface states, using neutral white and light-slate surfaces while preserving existing blue-violet accents. Video tiles and media overlays will remain dark. The light theme must meet WCAG AA contrast requirements with visible focus indicators and readable controls.",
      "Exact placement and presentation of the quick theme toggle",
      "Where and how the saved theme preference should be persisted"
    ]
  },
  "memoryContext": null
}
